# 📚 Recursion & Backtracking (Part 2) - Types of Recursion

## 📌 Introduction

Not all recursive functions behave the same way. Based on **where** and **how** the recursive call is made, recursion is classified into different types.

Understanding these types helps in solving complex recursive and backtracking problems efficiently.

